  "competency_questions": [
    "在交易发生且当时已知的证据中，哪些交易存在经确认的控制路径？",
    "共享电话、已到期控制或仅共同国家持股是否被错误当关联方？",
    "多路径、事件重放与合并披露边界如何避免双计？"
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "All identities/evidence are invented for this task. Party namespace is independent-synthetic.",
    "valid_to=null explicitly means ongoing, not an unknown end. Confirmed control is supplied evidence, not inferred from ownership.",
    "Amounts are whole yuan of CNY as an explicit synthetic assumption; the packaged Transaction model omits a unit property, recorded as finding F1.",
    "E1/v3 reversed is a newer state of the SAME event E1, not a separate negative-cash event; original source amount remains 45. Only current executed occurrence amounts are summed.",
    "Date-only task dates receive example Asia/Shanghai instants; those choices do not affect selection in the supplied dates.",
    "The consolidated disclosure variation is the package local demonstration rule for explicitly supplied scope, not a complete CAS36 legal determination."
  ],
  "unresolved": [
    "Actual applicability of the 2025 Chinese bank/insurance rule, full related-party definition, transaction classification, thresholds, governance procedure and reporting/disclosure duties.",
    "Authoritative current accounting standard/interpretations and complete disclosure requirements have not been independently verified; copied package explicitly records CAS36 original-page access limitation.",
    "Package method requires reversal/correction back-reference but sample graph has no explicit edge/property. This task groups E1 versions by SYS/E1 and records corrects_version in evidence outputs; distinct reversal-event linkage needs a declared model extension."
  ],
